{"kind": "mod", "id": 1419, "name": "Configurable Fall Damage", "slug": "configurable-fall-damage", "teaser": "Let's you configure the SafeHeight and DamagePerMeter.", "owner_name": "smthing", "downloads": 1195, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-13T18:05:23.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-05-18T16:13:46.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-05-18T16:13:46.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.8.0", "latest_version": "1.0.1", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>The defaults of this mod give you a little more freedom without being broken.</p>\n<p>Now jumping down a few steps will not break both your ankles and make you bleed.</p>\n<p>Use SafeHeight: 999 to disable fall damage completely.</p>\n<p>If using SPT Realism make sure this mod loads after it.</p>\n<p>SPT Defaults</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SafeHeight: 3</li>\n<li>DamagePerMeter: 9</li>\n</ul>\n<p>SPT Realism Mod Defaults</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SafeHeight: 2.1</li>\n<li>DamagePerMeter: 11</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This mod’s defaults</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SafeHeight: 4</li>\n<li>DamagePerMeter: 8</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Credits:</p>\n<p>ZThunderbags for the original <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/240-no-fall-damage/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">NoFallDamage</a> mod</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.flaticon.com/free-icons/fracture\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Modpage Icon</a></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 816, "published_at": "2024-05-18T17:25:23.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1419/configurable-fall-damage/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "lo